Wraithsong - The Ashen Choir
“Their hymns are not heard by the living alone. Even the dead stir when the Choir sings.”
Weapon Limit: None.
Race Limit: 1 per team.

Choir's Reward - (Passive)
Choir Allies gain 4/8/12/16/20% movement speed. Radius of 150/175/200/225/250.
Extra: This affects you aswell. This does NOT stack.

Reflexive Echo - (Victim)
When hit by a weapon, 5/10/15/20/25% chance to emit a false audio artifact for attacker.

Ashmark - (Attack)
3/6/9/12/15% chance to mark (highlight) an enemy for 5s. If successful, banish them for 1s.
The highlight is only for you.

Lament Shot - (Attack)
Consecutive strikes apply a stack of "Lament", at 3 stacks victim experiences delayed feedback (Lag) every .5s for .5/1/1.5/2/2.5 sec.
Also, 3/6/9/12/15% chance to impale and shake screen for 1s. (Duration doesn't apply to Imaple)
Extra: If you miss 1 bullet, stacks reset to 0. Mind your shots.

Chorus of Static - (Ability1)
Deploy an invisible zone for 1/2/3/4/5s. Enemies are not able to pass through during this time. (Highlight perimeter of effect, i.e. a doorway, vent, etc.) CD of 30s.
Type: Ward. Radius: 200u. Range: 800u.

Dissonant Presence - (Ability2)
Enemies within 400/450/500/550/600u radius hear FAKE faint, irregular audio artifacts (whispers, footsteps, fall damage, door opens, etc.) every 3s for 9s. CD of 30s.
Target: AoE_SELF. Type: Aura

Black Requiem - (Ultimate)
The battlefield goes quiet. ALL EFFECTS are muted for ALL PLAYERS within 100/200/300/400/500u for 10s. CD of 30s.
Extra: Also, replace audio with noise Lucky prefers (Logickal moaning, Lucky's Golden Scream, etc.) Target: AoE_SELF.

