Arcantria - The Ashen Choir
"They move unseen, weaving each note into the very minds of their enemies, until hesitation becomes inevitability."
Weapon Restriction: None.
Race Limit: 1 per team.

Waning Tempo - (Aura)
Enemies within a 50/100/150/200/250u radius are slowed gradually by 5%. Maximum slow is 70% movement speed.
Extra: Tick rate of 1s.

Residual Echo - (Victim)
5/10/15/20/25% chance to leave a decoy when attacked. If decoy is hit, attacker suffers 15% reduced fire rate for 3s.

Dimming Pulse - (Attack)
4/8/12/16/20% chance to 100% darken enemies screen (Blind) for .5sec.

Whispered Note - (Attack)
Reduce YOUR damage by 75%, each consecutive strike lowers victim's Skill AND Spell immunity by 4/8/12/16/20%.
Extra: CANNOT exceed -80%. Attack must be CONSECUTIVE (start stack after 2nd hit). Reset stacks if you miss.

Dirge of Prolongation- (Ability1)
Enemies CDs are extended by 10/11/12/13/15s while inside the radius. Upon leaving the radius, automatically set CD to 15s. CD of 45s.
Target: AoE_Self. Type: Ward. Radius: 300u. Duration: 10s.

Languid Refrain - (Ability2)
Enemies within the 150/200/250/300/350u are slowed by 20% and gradually lower skill and spell immunity by 5%. CD of 30s.
Extra: CANNOT exceed -80% loss.
Target: AoE_Self. Type: Ward. Duration: 10s. 

Eternal Rest - (Ultimate)
Add 10s to all enemies CDs and silence them. Duration 6/7/8/9/10s. CD of 30s.
Target: AoE_SELF. Radius: 500u.

