Lamentari - The Ashen Choir
"They wail into the minds of those who oppose the Ashen Choir. Their song freezes the brave, turns allies against instinct, and leaves terror as the only answer.”
Weapon Restrictions: None.
Race Limit: 1 per team.

Dissonant Hum - (Aura)
Enemies near the Lamentari gradually slow. Increments of 5 to 90/80/70/60/50% reduction.
Extra: 300u radius. Tick Rate: 1s. Slow is clamped to 30% movement speed.

Shrieking Chord - (Attack)
3/6/9/12/15% chance to apply "Fear" stacks. At 4 stacks, turn (180) and slow enemy by 20% for 2s.
Extra: Stacks fall off after 10s.

Quivering Cadence - (Attack)
10/15/20/25/30% chance to leech 50% weapon damage from target.

Inverted Echo - (Victim)
5/10/15/20/25% chance to invert (turn 180) attackers camera when hit.

Reverberant Dirge - (Kill)
Each kill by the Lamentari spreads a short-lived DoT to enemies within 100/125/150/175/200u.
Extra: Duration 5s. Damage: 1/1/1/2/2.

Veil of Discord - (Ability1)
Enemies within the veil experience minor, constant disorientation (Randomized bash, blind, turn, banish, etc.) and receive 4/8/12/16/20% increased magic damage. CD of 30s.
Extra: Target AoE_SELF. Radius: 300u. Tick Rate: 1s. Duration of effect: .5s Duration of Ward: 5s.

Crescendo of Terror - (Ultimate)
Enemies hit are briefly frozen (bashed) and close their eyes (blinded) in fear. CD of 30s.
Extra: Target: AoE_SELF. Radius: 400u. Duration: 2s.
